<%- include('partials/header.ejs') %>

<body>
  <div class="main">
    <h1><%= title %></h1>
    <br>
    <p>Welcome to Justin's Fast Food Restaurant!</p>
    <p>
      This is a website that implements Create, Read, Update, and Delete functionality of
      a database. It uses a connection to MongoDB for storing the data, and was generated
      from the Express Generator library with ejs used for the view templates. The primary
      purpose of this application is to show a website that can edit a collection/database 
      that is hosted on a server from a remote platform and have full capabilities 
      while doing so. It also provides an example of a pratical, real world application 
      for this development method and logic.
    </p>
    <p>
      Go to /menu to take a look at a sample list of ordered items, modify them, or alternatively
      click below.</p>
    <br>
    
    <a href="/menu">
      <img src="/Assets/images/menu.png" class="menuImg">
    </a>
  </div>
</body>

